.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039960/extras/d9220054e79bcfa798f06eb01cc8dfb7.webm?t=1755332522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039960/extras/d9220054e79bcfa798f06eb01cc8dfb7.mp4?t=1755332522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What the World Once Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world long fallen, the boy meets a girl bound by illness. To free her, he steps into the darkness overrun by machines. Whether you choose to follow her guidance is a decision only you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039960/extras/3284410f0f0627fa079a60d77e6b1519.poster.avif?t=1755332522\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039960/extras/3284410f0f0627fa079a60d77e6b1519.webm?t=1755332522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039960/extras/3284410f0f0627fa079a60d77e6b1519.mp4?t=1755332522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
